{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a world of adventure and puzzles in this game that pays tribute to the Game Boy era!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/047ada9317048497f59bcfa3927fec83.poster.avif?t=1748011806\" width=582 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/047ada9317048497f59bcfa3927fec83.webm?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/047ada9317048497f59bcfa3927fec83.mp4?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a mysterious place filled with secrets and challenges. Your mission is to use all your reasoning skills to discover the best strategy to collect keys, unlock doors, and reach the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each level brings new obstacles, requiring you to think creatively and quickly to overcome barriers and uncover hidden secrets.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a nostalgic and challenging experience, where every move counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path is full of dangers: holes, spikes, traps, destructive platforms, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping on destructive platforms requires attention, as they disappear right after contact. Treacherous holes and hidden traps make every step a critical decision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically placed levers unlock new areas, adding an extra layer of strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/00360ab16c541913c0b96835d2ebcb2f.poster.avif?t=1748011806\" width=624 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/00360ab16c541913c0b96835d2ebcb2f.webm?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/00360ab16c541913c0b96835d2ebcb2f.mp4?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every move counts, and precision in jumping is essential in <i>Condemned: No Escape</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combination of precise jumps and puzzle-solving makes each stage require not only agility but also careful analysis of the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering these mechanics offers a highly rewarding sense of achievement, especially as the secrets of the place are unveiled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake can be costly, making precision one of the most important elements for success in your escape.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3307350?t=1748011806","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3307350?t=1748011806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/6b076085c702289654e02340e5cacb418291b10b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748011806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/6b076085c702289654e02340e5cacb418291b10b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748011806","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3346380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>ADD TO WISHILIST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/585c280d28261325ada68a0faa266ae0.poster.avif?t=1748011806\" width=720 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/585c280d28261325ada68a0faa266ae0.webm?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/585c280d28261325ada68a0faa266ae0.mp4?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a world of adventure and puzzles in this game that pays tribute to the Game Boy era!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/047ada9317048497f59bcfa3927fec83.poster.avif?t=1748011806\" width=582 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/047ada9317048497f59bcfa3927fec83.webm?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/047ada9317048497f59bcfa3927fec83.mp4?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a mysterious place filled with secrets and challenges. Your mission is to use all your reasoning skills to discover the best strategy to collect keys, unlock doors, and reach the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Each level brings new obstacles, requiring you to think creatively and quickly to overcome barriers and uncover hidden secrets.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a nostalgic and challenging experience, where every move counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path is full of dangers: holes, spikes, traps, destructive platforms, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping on destructive platforms requires attention, as they disappear right after contact. Treacherous holes and hidden traps make every step a critical decision. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically placed levers unlock new areas, adding an extra layer of strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/00360ab16c541913c0b96835d2ebcb2f.poster.avif?t=1748011806\" width=624 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/00360ab16c541913c0b96835d2ebcb2f.webm?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/extras/00360ab16c541913c0b96835d2ebcb2f.mp4?t=1748011806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every move counts, and precision in jumping is essential in <i>Condemned: No Escape</i>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combination of precise jumps and puzzle-solving makes each stage require not only agility but also careful analysis of the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering these mechanics offers a highly rewarding sense of achievement, especially as the secrets of the place are unveiled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake can be costly, making precision one of the most important elements for success in your escape.</p>","developers":["Ilustra Mundo games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307350/header.jpg?t=1748011806","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3307350/380756539/9c087462f700f868bdc4c2fd3382f7ba28d90086/1750977747/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748011801","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3307350/380756539/9c087462f700f868bdc4c2fd3382f7ba28d90086/1750977747/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748011801","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3307350/380756539/9c087462f700f868bdc4c2fd3382f7ba28d90086/1750977747/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748011801","id":257143900,"name":"Trailer2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143900/2cbe669f5f7557a8e4fb676b846cc36d25a1cea4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748011801"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3307350/784189/d5d131e767a4815a5cf6bb6b117112b4d6bcc746/1750977746/dash_av1.mpd?t=1731341117","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3307350/784189/d5d131e767a4815a5cf6bb6b117112b4d6bcc746/1750977746/dash_h264.mpd?t=1731341117","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3307350/78418